BIB                  3         16
REACTION   (3-LI-6(A,G)5-B-10,,SGV)
ANALYSIS   The contributions of the different reaction
           components to the reaction rate are considered: one
           with only the known resonance contributions, and one
           that includes both nonresonant tails of subthreshold
           and higher energy states as well as direct capture.
           contributions.
